-block;width:100%;max-width:268px;vertical-align:top;padding:0 4px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:separate;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #E3E8F2;"><tr><td style="padding:18px 18px 20px;text-align:left;"><div style="font-family:''Inter'',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#F5A524;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:8px;">★★★★★</div><div style="font-family:''Inter'',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#0F1B33;font-style:italic;margin-bottom:10px;">&ldquo;Uso há 4 meses e não pretendo parar. Me sinto muito mais equilibrada. É difícil explicar, mas o organismo responde.&rdquo;</div><div style="font-family:''Inter'',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#07388E;">Cláudia M.</div></td></tr></table></div><div class="col" style="display:inline-block;width:100%;max-width:268px;vertical-align:top;padding:0 4px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:separate;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #E3E8F2;"><tr><td style="padding:18px 18px 20px;text-align:left;"><div style="font-family:''Inter'',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#F5A524;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:8px;">★★★★★</div><div style="font-family:''Inter'',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#0F1B33;font-style:italic;margin-bottom:10px;">&ldquo;Estava com desconfiança total. Resolvi tentar. Após 21 dias no protocolo de choque, os resultados apareceram. Hoje indico para a família inteira.&rdquo;</div><div style="font-family:''Inter'',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#07388E;">Juliana C.</div></td></tr></table></div></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding:0 32px 22px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border